bhagavān āha | 

tryasram udārarūpiṇaṃ sarvabuddhaguṇālayaṃ | 

ete ´kārādirūpeṇa buddhaguṇāḥ praviśyamānāḥ sphaṭikendusaṃnibhāḥ | praviśyante tadupari prakṛti­prabhāsvara­cittasya sphītīkaraṇa­hetoḥ | anena mantreṇa bodhicittam utpādayen mantrī |

oṁ bodhicittam utpādayāmi || 3.4.24 ||

