śṛṇvantu sarvatathāgatāḥ | punar vajrasattvaṃ sarvākāravaropetaṃ buddhabimbaṃ bhāvayed anena mantreṇa |

oṁ yathā sarvatathāgatās tathāham || 3.4.36 ||

kāyaguhyaṃ tathā caryā gocaram tattvabodhanam |
