pādaṃ darśayed yā tu talaṃ tasyāḥ pradarśayet || 4.4.6 ||

aṅguliṃ darśayed yā tu nakhaṃ tasyāḥ pradarśayet |
bhūmiṃ darśayed yā tu ākāśaṃ tasyāḥ pradarśayet || 4.4.7 ||

ākāśaṃ darśayed yā tu sūryaṃ tasyāḥ pradarśayet |
nadīṃ darśayed yā tu samudraṃ tasyāḥ pradarśayet || 4.4.8 ||

ekāṅguliṃ darśayed yā tu svāgatam ity uktaṃ bhavati |
dvayor aṅguliṃ darśayed yā tu susvāgatam ity uktaṃ bhavati || 4.4.9 ||

