tṛtīye dhanurdharā caiva puṣpair jaṭās suveṣṭitā || 7.4.70 ||

sitapadmasaṃsthā tu raktaprabhālaṃkṛtā |
krodhajvālāsphurāvahāṃ krodhajvālābhiḥ saṃtrastā || 7.4.71 ||

dagdhāḥ prajāṃ hiṃsanti ye grahāḥ || 7.4.72 ||

krodhajvalitā • akṣepā • akṣobhyāvaṣṭabdhaśirāḥ |
punaḥ śvetā pañcavarṇabuddhāmṛtapravarṣikām || 7.4.73 ||
 
prāgvat savyetaramukhām | evaṃ bhāvayed yogī vaidṛśya sarvamāyāyās tu śāntaye | sarvarujāpanayanā nāma parṇaśāvarī ||

ity āha bhagavān mahāvajras tathāgataḥ || 7.4.74 ||

śṛṇu devi mahābhāge vajrakrodhasya bhāvanām |
krodhamūrtiṃ samādhāya krodharājaṃ prabhāvayet || 7.4.75 ||

caturbhujaṃ caturvaktraṃ yāval lakṣabhujaṃ tathā |
sitadehaṃ mahākrodhaṃ nirīkṣantaṃ vajravārāhīṃ tadvarṇāyudhadhāriṇīm || 7.4.76 ||

kapālamālinaṃ vīraṃ bhasmagātrāvalepanam |
pañcamudrāvibhūṣitaṃ jaṭāmukuṭāṅkaśūlinam || 7.4.77 ||

īṣaddaṃṣṭrākarālāsyaṃ mahāpretakṛtāsanam |
aṣṭadalamahāpadme raktavarṇasamaprabham || 7.4.78 ||

caturvidyāsamāyuktaṃ buddhabimbopaśobhitam |
hayarūpādyā caturbhujā caturvaktrā sarpābharaṇabhūṣitā || 7.4.79 ||

akṣarākṣarasaṃyuktaṃ kapālasthaṃ śuklavarṇaṃ |
caturmukhavirājitam yaralavair bhūṣitam || 7.4.80 ||

sādhyaṃ yāvad pādam ārabhya vidhinā dhūmraraktapītasita­vāyavyādi yathākramam | anena dhyāna­dṛṣṭa­mātreṇa striyaṃ drāvayati kṣīravṛkṣa iva nānyathā || 7.4.81 ||

raṁkārākṣarasaṃyuktaṃ raktavarṇaṃ caturbhujam |
