% Chapter 10

% Part 1

śṛṇu vajrapāṇe vajrācāryasya siddhisamayam |
kalpayitvā mahācakram ādyaṃ hṛdayamaṇḍalam || 10.1.1 ||

praviṣṭaṃ svayam ādyaṃ tu svābhiṣekādivistaraiḥ |
vajrācāryatvam asamaṃ sidhyate nātra saṃśayaḥ || 10.1.2 ||

yasmāt saṃśrutaṃ dhyānatatparatvād vajrācāryatāṃ vrajet |
vajrasattvahṛdādīnāṃ lakṣajāpāt prasidhyate || 10.1.3 ||

ādyasiddho mahācāryaḥ sarvakalpāgraṃ sidhyati |
vidhinānenāpi jinā bhavanti sattvā iti kva saṃdehaḥ || 10.1.4 ||

nirdvandvāḥ sotsāhās tattvasthā baddhasaṃnāhāḥ || 10.1.5 ||

yā yā mudrā kathitā sarvajñair yasya yasya kulabhedāt |
tāṃ tāṃ gṛhya vidhānaiḥ sādhyā sā sā tena tenaiva || 10.1.6 ||

mohātmā khalu mātaraṃ vedavatīṃ vā dvijātmājāṃ gṛhya |
mohaviśuddhyā dhyāyī sākṣād vairocano bhavati || 10.1.7 || 

uttamavidyā mātā yady api pitrā pūrvaṃ saṃbhuktā |
siddhis tathāpi tayaiva bhavatīti mahāsukhaḥ prāha || 10.1.8 ||

dveṣātmā caṇḍālīduhitaraṃ vā yakṣakanyāṃ saṃgṛhya |
dveṣaviśuddhyā dhyāyī sākṣād akṣobhyatāṃ yāti || 10.1.9 ||

rāgātmā naṭadārāṃ bhaginīṃ vā gṛhya nāginīm asurīṃ |
rāgaviśuddhyā dhyāyī • amitābho bhavati bhāvena || 10.1.10 ||

īrṣyātmā śilpajñām apsararāmāṃ saṃgṛhya bhāgineyīṃ vā | 
īrṣyāviśuddhyā dhyāyī • amoghasiddhir bhaved vīraḥ || 10.1.11 ||

mānātmā nṛpakanyāṃ vidyādharadārikāṃ vadhūṃ gṛhya |
mānaviśuddhyā dhyāyī san maṇikulasaṃbhavo bhavati || 10.1.12 ||

locanayā saha buddho māmakyā caiva sidhyate • akṣobhya | 
pāṇḍurayā saha padmī tārāsahitaḥ sidhyate • amoghaḥ || 10.1.13 || 

ratnolkayā saha ratnī sidhyate ceti yuktir uktā • iyam |
sidhyanty anye ´py anayā krodhā devyaś ca jinaprajāḥ || 10.1.14 ||

krodhāḥ pracaṇḍavidhinā śāntāḥ sidhyante śāntavidhinaiva | 
raktā rāgodaraiḥ sidhyante mānino puṣṭyā || 10.1.15 || 

evam akaṣṭopāyaṃ sarvajñair varṇitaṃ sukāruṇikaiḥ |
sukhasādhanam atyantaṃ duḥkaracaryāvratarahitaṃ || 10.1.16 ||

prāpya • evaṃ tv amṛtarasaṃ kleśavināśāya nodyamo yasya |
sa kathaṃ duḥkaraniyamaiḥ kartuṃ śaknoti buddhatvam || 10.1.17 ||

yo na karoti • ātmārthaṃ mūḍhātmā svasukhasādhanaṃ prāpya |
cyutvā • itaḥ kva gamiṣyati punar iti na jñāyate tasya || 10.1.18 || 

itthaṃ buddhvā sarvadā sanena dṛṣṭā karma svapnamāyeva sarvam | 
tat kartavyaṃ buddhadharmasyājñaḥ saṃsārārṇavāt pāraṃ yāvan na yāti || 10.1.19 ||

iti • ācāryamudrādhiṣṭhānadaśamasya prathamaṃ prakaraṇam ||


% Part 2 1219

atha yasmin vidyāpuruṣas tasminn īdṛgvibhavo bhavati |
calitaiva ṣaḍvikāraṃ harṣollāsātmanā pṛthivī || 10.2.1 ||

raṇatīyam eva hṛṣṭā magadhabhavā kaṃsikā sadṛśaṃ |
nipatanty ulkāpātāḥ kalpānalasaṃnibhā daśasu dikṣu || 10.2.2 ||

kṣubhitamahodadhiśabdāḥ sarvatra patanti nirghātāḥ |
saṃvartavahnirūpā jñānālokā jvalanti tatraiva || 10.2.3 ||

mudrāgarbhāḥ sarve sakalatraidhātukā lokāḥ | 
brahmā viṣṇur varuṇaḥ śakro rudro ´gnir aśvinau bhānuś candraḥ || 10.2.4 || 

yakṣāḥ siddhā gandharvāḥ kiṃnarā nāgā vidyādharāḥ |
apsarādyā ye cānyatra trayastriṃśavāsino devāḥ || 10.2.5 ||

tatrāgatya prakaraṃ kiranti kusumena saṃhṛṣṭāḥ |
vīnāveṇumukundair madhurīśaṃkhakāhalāśabdaiḥ || 10.2.6 ||

nandīpaṭahamṛḍaṅgair gaganasthāḥ pūjayanty ete |
nṛtyanty apsarakanyā vidyādhararājabālikāḥ sarvāḥ || 10.2.7 ||

kurvanty anekavādyaṃ gāyanti ca kiṃnarāḥ | 
yakṣā jaya jaya śabdoddhānaṃ krīḍāṃ kurvanti || 10.2.8 || 

tatra saṃmodam prayacchanti sādhukāraṃ siddhā ye nabhasthitā devā ye tuṣitasthā devapravarā ye parāpara­vasa­vartinaś ca surāsuraputrā vidyādharāś cāgatya praṇamanty akaṇiṣṭhaparyantāḥ || 10.2.9 || 

nānāpuṣpaprakaraṃ nānāgandhena gandhavarṣaṃ ca nānādhūpa­viśeśaṃ ca kurvanty atibhaktirūpeṇa | kiṃ tava kathitenānyenāpi hi vistararūpeṇa | sādhyapuṇyena traidhātuṣu yā pujās tābhiḥ saṃpūjayanty ete || 10.2.10 ||

iti mahāsukhasiddhipūjāsatkāro nāma daśamasya dvitīyaṃ prakaraṇam ||


% Part 3

siddho vidyāpuruṣaḥ kva gataḥ kva tiṣṭhati | etat saṃśayo me | kathayasva mahāsukha || 10.3.1 ||

bhagavān āha |

siddho vidyāpuruṣaḥ kvacid api na gataḥ kvacit sthito naiva | ādyantamadhya­rahito nirdvandvas tribhuvanālokaḥ | sarvagataḥ sarvajñaḥ sārvaḥ sarvārthaḥ | sarva­sattva­cittasthaḥ sarvāpāya­vinirmuktaḥ | sarvaguṇālaṃkṛtaḥ sarvīyaḥ | śiva-m-asamo nityodito nāthas trātā vidhūtasaṃkalpaḥ | saṃsthāna­varṇa­rahito ´pi jinasyāgocaro rājā || 10.3.2 ||

vajraṃ durbhedyatvāc candraḥ kleśopatāpamuktatvāt | 
niḥśaṃkatvāt siṃho jalarāśir duravagāhatvāt || 10.3.3 ||

evam upamānair vividhair yogibhir upamīyate | sa evaikaḥ kurute ´rthaṃ sarvasattvānāṃ || 10.3.4 ||

vikalpaprahīṇo ´pi jātiṃ darśayati parām | abhiniṣkramaṇaṃ svabālalīlāṃ ca | svayam eva bhikṣubhāvaṃ | vajrāsana­bhūmi­saṃkramaṇam | māra­dhvaṃsanam | asama­saṃbuddhatvam | dharmacakra­nirdeśam | devāvatāra­ramyam aticitraṃ prātihāryaṃ ca | dhana­pāla­hasti­vinayam | bhavya­janasyāvatāraṇa­śuddham | paravādi­nigrahaṇaṃ niravadya­piṇḍapātraṃ ca | trailokya­cakra­damanaṃ yuvarājyaṃ caiva bodhisattvasya | parinirvāṇa­mahārthaṃ traidhātuṣu dharmarājyaṃ ca || 10.3.5 ||

evaṃ te kulaputrāḥ | evam anekaviśeṣaṃ svapnākhyaṃ buddhanāṭakaṃ divyaṃ darśayati yas tu siddho māyārūpeṇa sakalajagadartham || 10.3.6 ||

iti buddhamāyāvikurvitaṃ nāma daśamasya tṛtīyaṃ prakaraṇam ||


% Part 4

kathitaṃ deva tvayā pūrvaṃ viṇmūtrarudhiramatsyamāṃsahomanam || 10.4.1 || 

kathaṃ vai jñānasattveṣu • aśucimukhapūraṇe | 
kathaṃ na jāyate pāpaṃ yadi pāpaḥ kathaṃ phalam || 10.4.2 ||

bhagavān āha |

ajñānamūḍhās tu ye sattvā jñānopāyavivarjitāḥ |
bāhyavastvabhiniviṣṭā vai vikalpajālajaḍīkṛtāḥ || 10.4.3 || {Cv}

teṣāṃ pāpaṃ ca puṇyaṃ ca rāśidvayavikalpanā |
svabhāvaśuddhā ime dharmā anutpannā anālayāḥ || 10.4.4 ||

upāyaṃ darśitaṃ buddhaiḥ sattvānāṃ jñānavṛddhaye |
puṇyaṃ paramārthatas tyājyam apuṇyasya tu ko grahaḥ || 10.4.5 ||

pāragāmī yathā sattvo nadīm udakapūritām |
kāṣṭhatṛṇāni saṃhṛtya • udakāt plavane kṛte || 10.4.6 ||

tatra lagnaḥ samuttīrya tyaktvā gacchet sukhena tu |
evaṃ saṃsārapārasya dharmādharmāvarohitaḥ || 10.4.7 ||

sukhena prāpyate bodhir dharmādharmavivarjitā |
tasmād vikalpajālaṃ tu tyaktvā dharmagambhīravardhitaḥ || 10.4.8 ||

tathāgatodite mārge na vikalpayen mantravit |
vikalpo hi mahāmohaḥ saṃsārodadhipātakaḥ || 10.4.9 ||

nirvikalpasamādhistho bhāti kham iva nirmalaḥ |
dvayendriyasamāpattyā kāyavākcittamīlanaiḥ || 10.4.10 ||

ahaṃkārayate jinabimbaṃ sarvākāravivarjitam |
niṣpādyeta tu vai jñānaṃ jñānino haiva janmani || 10.4.11 ||

strīpuruṣavigrahā ´nekā karmotpattir vidarśitā |
ajñānenaiva vikurvīta samayo ´yaṃ kāyavajriṇaḥ || 10.4.12 ||

cittaṃ naiva praduṣyet sattvānāṃ vividhatāpanaiḥ |
duḥsaṃkalpakalpanājānaiḥ samayo ´yaṃ cittavajriṇaḥ || 10.4.13 ||

naiva vācāṃ hi bhāṣet piśunaṃ duṣṭakharādinam |
śrotrā sukhakaraṃ caiva samayo ´yaṃ vāgvajriṇaḥ || 10.4.14 ||

māṃsadhātusthito buddho vairocano mahāgrajaḥ |
bhyavāsinaḥ • raktaṃ ratnābho mahāmaṇivibhūṣitaḥ || 10.4.15 ||

asthir amitābhaḥ sattvānāṃ sarveṣāṃ saṃkulāvahe |
sirābandhe †vidhānād dhāred† amoghamunipuṃgavaḥ || 10.4.16 ||

guhyaṃ te mayā khyātaṃ samayo jñānakovidām || 10.4.17 ||

sevyāḥ satataṃ bhāvyāś cittavajreṇa dhīmatā |
rāgo dveṣas tathā mohas tṛṣṇā saṃskāravardhitaḥ || 10.4.18 ||

ete pañca kathitā munipuṃgavaiḥ | viṇmūtraśukraśleṣmāsṛkparisravāḥ | catur­bhūta­parigrahāḥ samayāḥ sevanīyās tu niṣpannam atibhāvanaiḥ | bhakṣaṇīyāni sarvadā || 10.4.19 || 

yathāṅganābālakathānumoditaṃ |
	saṃlāpasaṃparkakathāṃ ca khyāpitam || 
mārgo ´pi khyāpitaṃ na ca bandhanaṃ ca | 
	evaṃvidhaṃ yogisumārgadarśitam || 10.4.20 ||

atha sarvaparṣadi yogayoginī ḍākaḍākinī•aśītikoṭyaś ca bodhisattvās tathāgatasaṅgham anekadhā prītiprahlādacittaṃ tu sarvatathāgata­jñānalābhī tu sarvataḥ | vajragarbha­pramukhā bodhisattvā mahāsattvāḥ sarve ca te deva­nāga­yakṣa­gandharvāḥ sā ca sarvāvatī parṣad bhagavato bhāṣitam abhyanandann iti || 10.4.21 ||

iti śrīsaṃpuṭodbhavasarvatantranidānamahākalparājo daśamaḥ samāptaḥ ||
